                                "sense_id": "bb66f2fa-4544-3f35-9c7e-c487c284b48a",
                                "text": "Kepler, who excelled as an imaginative writer , replied: 'I will not make an old man of Saturn, nor slaves of his attendant globes; but rather let this tricorporate form be Geryon so shall Galileo be Hercules, and the telescope[…]'"
                            },
